      "import_guide_step_1": "Sign in to Hermes, open your Profile, then choose Import Data from the avatar menu (top right) to open this dialog.",
      "import_guide_step_2": "Supported formats: GPX, TCX, FIT, and ZIP archives that contain those files. Export running activities when you can—analytics work best with run data.",
